<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: Mech LMG -->
  <DMS_Turret_LightMachineGun.label>機兵輕機槍</DMS_Turret_LightMachineGun.label>
  <!-- EN: A weapon specializing in supression chambered in a large caliber rifle round.\n\nThis weapon is specially designed for automatroid use, normal humans will struggle to use it without external equipment or augmentations.\n\nIts folding bipod lets a drafted operator drop it into a firing position on the spot, and pick it back up just as quickly. -->
  <DMS_Turret_LightMachineGun.description>使用全威力步槍彈的壓制性武器。\n\n這種武器是專門為機兵設計的，因此如果沒有外部輔助設備或超強的力量，普通人可能無法正常使用。\n\n附有可摺疊的兩腳架，徵召中的操作者可以就地把它架設成射擊陣地，也能同樣迅速地收起帶走。</DMS_Turret_LightMachineGun.description>

  <!-- EN: mech LMG -->
  <DMS_Gun_LightMachineGun.label>機兵輕機槍</DMS_Gun_LightMachineGun.label>
  <!-- EN: A light machine gun mounted on a folding bipod. -->
  <DMS_Gun_LightMachineGun.description>架設在摺疊兩腳架上的輕機槍。</DMS_Gun_LightMachineGun.description>
  <!-- EN: mech LMG -->
  <DMS_Gun_LightMachineGun.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>機兵輕機槍</DMS_Gun_LightMachineGun.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>

  <!-- UNUSED -->
  <DMS_Gun_LightMachineGun.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>機兵輕機槍</DMS_Gun_LightMachineGun.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>

  <!-- EN: Mech Grenade Launcher -->
  <DMS_Turret_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.label>機兵榴彈發射器</DMS_Turret_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.label>
  <!-- EN: A handheld automatic grenade launcher for clearing out clustered targets.\n\nThis weapon is specially designed for automatroid use, normal humans will struggle to use it without external equipment or augmentations.\n\nDropped onto its tripod it gains the reach and the settled arc it can never hold from the shoulder, and a crew can break it down again in seconds. -->
  <DMS_Turret_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.description>手持式自動榴彈發射器，用於清除集群目標。\n\n這種武器是專門為機兵設計的，因此如果沒有外部輔助設備或超強的力量，普通人可能無法正常使用。\n\n架上三腳架後，它能取得肩射永遠達不到的射程與穩定射界，收攏拆解也只要幾秒。</DMS_Turret_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.description>

  <!-- EN: mech grenade launcher -->
  <DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.label>機兵榴彈發射器</DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.label>
  <!-- EN: An automatic grenade launcher mounted on a low tripod. -->
  <DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.description>架設在低腳三腳架上的自動榴彈發射器。</DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.description>
  <!-- EN: mech grenade launcher -->
  <DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile_AmmoSwitch.label>機兵榴彈發射器</DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile_AmmoSwitch.label>

  <!-- UNUSED -->
  <DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>機兵榴彈發射器</DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>

  <!-- EN: HE grenade -->
  <DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.label>高爆榴彈</DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.label>
  <!-- EN: A high-explosive fragmentation round for clearing out clustered targets. The standard belt. -->
  <DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.description>用來清除集群目標的高爆破片榴彈。標準彈鏈。</DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.description>
  <!-- EN: EMP grenade -->
  <DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.label>EMP榴彈</DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.label>
  <!-- EN: A capacitor round that stuns mechanoids and turrets in a small radius instead of destroying them. Useless against flesh, and the heavier fuze assembly slows the burst. -->
  <DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.description>以放電電容取代炸藥的榴彈，會在小範圍內癱瘓機械體與砲塔而非將其摧毀。對血肉之軀毫無作用，較重的引信組件也拖慢了連射速度。</DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.description>
  <!-- EN: smoke grenade -->
  <DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.2.label>煙霧榴彈</DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.2.label>
  <!-- EN: A screening round that lays a smoke bank where it lands. Lighter than the explosive rounds, so it flies a little further and comes on target faster. -->
  <DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.2.description>在彈著點鋪開一片煙幕的遮蔽彈。比爆炸性彈種輕，因此飛得稍遠、瞄準也更快。</DMS_Gun_AutomaticGrenadeLauncher.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.2.description>

  <!-- EN: Mech HMG -->
  <DMS_Turret_HeavyMachineGun.label>機兵重機槍</DMS_Turret_HeavyMachineGun.label>
  <!-- EN: A heavy machine gun for mech soldiers or infantry support platforms.\n\nThis weapon is designed specifically for automatroid use,it's so heavy only specific automatroids can operate it unless it's mounted to a support platform.\n\nOn its tripod the receiver stops fighting the gunner: the beaten zone tightens, the belt runs longer, and the gun holds ground no shoulder ever could. -->
  <DMS_Turret_HeavyMachineGun.description>一挺發射大口徑機槍彈的重型機槍，普遍用於重型機兵或步兵支援平臺。\n\n這種武器是專門為機兵設計的，因為其重量因此所以只有特定的機兵才能操作。\n\n架上三腳架後，機匣不再和射手較勁：彈著散布收攏、彈鏈跑得更長，火力點守得住肩射守不住的地段。</DMS_Turret_HeavyMachineGun.description>

  <!-- EN: mech HMG -->
  <DMS_Gun_HeavyMachineGun.label>機兵重機槍</DMS_Gun_HeavyMachineGun.label>
  <!-- EN: A heavy machine gun mounted on a tripod. -->
  <DMS_Gun_HeavyMachineGun.description>架設在三腳架上的重機槍。</DMS_Gun_HeavyMachineGun.description>
  <!-- EN: mech HMG -->
  <DMS_Gun_HeavyMachineGun.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile_AmmoSwitch.label>機兵重機槍</DMS_Gun_HeavyMachineGun.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile_AmmoSwitch.label>

  <!-- UNUSED -->
  <DMS_Gun_HeavyMachineGun.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>機兵重機槍</DMS_Gun_HeavyMachineGun.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>

</LanguageData>
